<title>GERMANY: Plettac to take over Portugal's Andais.</title>
<headline>Plettac to take over Portugal's Andais.</headline>
<dateline>PLETTENBERG, Germany 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German scaffolding maker Plettac AG said on Friday it had agreed to take over Portuguese construction firm Andais Lda.</p>
<p>The deal foresaw Plettac, via its subsidiary Arnholdt Holding, taking on 70 percent of Andais, Plettac said in a mandatory statement.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
